  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> &nbsp;</span>has released the answer key for the post of Excise Constable Competitive Examination (JECCE)-2023. This recruitment was released for 583 posts. Applications for the JSSC Excise Constable JECCE Recruitment 2023 were accepted from June 01, 2023, to July 10, 2023. The written examination was held on 12 April 2026. Candidates who appeared for this examination can Download their JSSC Excise Constable JECCE 2023 Answer Key 2026 from the link given below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Jharkhand Staff Selection Commission (JSSC)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">JSSC Excise Constable JECCE 2023 Admit Card 2026 </span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Advt No. : 06/2023</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>01 June 2023</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>10 July 2023</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>12 July 2023</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Last Date for Photo/ Sign Upload :<strong> 14 July 2023</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Online Correction&nbsp;:<strong>&nbsp;16 to 18 July 2023</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">PET Exam Start On : <strong>22 August 2024</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">PET Admit Card Available : <strong>13 August 2024 &nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">PET Exam Postponed Date : <strong>03 to 05 September 2024 &nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Revised PET Admit Card Available : <strong>08 September 2024 &nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Revised PET Start On : <strong>10 September 2024 &nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Written Exam Date : <strong>12 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Exam City Details : <strong>03 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Admit Card : <b>09 April 2026</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Answer Key : <b>22 April 2026</b></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, BC, EBC, EWS Candidates : <strong>Rs. 100/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST Candidates of Jharkhand : <strong>Rs. 50/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>JSSC Excise Constable JECCE Notification 2023 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>18 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>25 Years (UR-</strong>Male<strong>)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>27 Years (BC/ EBC-</strong>Male<strong>)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>28 Years (UR/ EWS/ BC/ EBC-</strong>Female<strong>)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>30 Years (SC/ ST-</strong>Male &amp; Female<strong>)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per JSSC Excise Constable JECCE Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>JSSC Excise Constable JECCE 2023 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 583 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 40.9732%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 30.0591%; text-align: center;\"><